{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following is the negation of the statement: For all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> of a certain set, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/3/80336160f9dfd806f37621fd3f604771d8a85c5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/7/d57c23259e7495298d5f36f5d66c0c401ee7aee0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{For all x}, x^2 &lt; 0\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{For all x}, x^2 \\le 0\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{For no x}, x^2&gt;0\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{For some x}, x^2&gt;0\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{For some x}, x^2 \\le 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"531\" height=\"39\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The given statement is false if and only if there exists <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> is not greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/b/74bfb43989acf76b13db36021e7b83f4a84d84ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" />).  Thus the negation of the given statement is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/c/c8c4447b6b3c63e1815363b82f06ca1649d93bf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{For some }x\\text{, }x^2 \\leq 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"189\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>(A), (B), (C) are incorrect as they fail to include cases where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/5/7659bdfb4c0e694fcc5499be7685c6499896d9ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> for one value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/7/1976e6e8f2e327f03732bfc6b0775cd181413ef9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> for another value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>(D) is incorrect as it fails to include cases where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/7/37777cb79ffa995eca939de9a0aee5814f273f23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 \\leq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"53\" height=\"19\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Recall that the negation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/3/7f36c7d06c82486cd11049f6654474f36ddbc352.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall x P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"61\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/e/c7e130bf03d2b403806ec53cb5fbfca06403419b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\exists x(\\lnot P(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Thus the negation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/5/975c8b3180610f0aa2680148dd0ec2b7d77d0a6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall x(x^2 &gt; 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"21\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/c/4fc392fb4877501b0387008ade6d900876435b99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\exists x(x^2 \\leq 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/c/c8c4447b6b3c63e1815363b82f06ca1649d93bf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{For some }x\\text{, }x^2 \\leq 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"189\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Probl